# The repository root is NOT the web root — public/ is.
#
# This file exists for the case where that is configured wrongly: a
# virtual-host pointed at the repository root, or a control panel that serves a
# directory it should not. With it, a misconfigured site returns 403 for
# everything instead of serving application code, configuration, migrations,
# logs or uploads.
#
# Do not edit this to "make the site work". Fix the docroot instead: it must be
# the public/ directory.
Require all denied
